# What Cloud Build must not receive.
#
# This file exists rather than being inferred from .gitignore because the two want
# different things. `web/run.json` is committed on purpose, and it has to reach the
# image so the deployed page has a real run on first paint. The masters must not: they
# are 190 MB of public-domain film that the container fetches from archive.org on boot,
# where a judge can check them against the same source Interlock measured.

.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.env
.uicraft-read.json

# The fleet, and anything a run produced locally.
data/
work/
logs/
